</picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE FULL SPEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Will you show honor by trusting your driving skills?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerial control allowing flips, rolls, and driving on walls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars behave differently depending on the surfaces they drive on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=650 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do you prefer more radical methods?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your friends off the track and into traps with arcade-style, physics-based driving: drifts, accelerations, jumps, flips and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=650 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use obstacles and their various effects to create insane shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving altered by various <strong>modifiers</strong>: increasing reverse speed, adding bonuses when doing a flip, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track disrupted by various <strong>modifiers</strong>: swap the start and finish lines, transform all surfaces, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of tracks, many obstacles and modifiers to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle with accessories, designs, and paints that you can unlock throughout the game and in different game modes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.poster.avif?t=1753467874\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.webm?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.mp4?t=1753467874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game statistics: obstacles placed, and content unlocked. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode with a ghost to beat on each track, unlocking an accessory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITH FRIENDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editable rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players online and/or locally in split screen.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Race against your friends and alter the track by placing obstacles after each lap. Change the rules mid-game with roguelike modifiers. Shove your opponents off the track, drift, boost and jump. Up to 4 players online and local split-screen.",
